sequenceDiagram
    actor User as User
    participant API as UploadFileController
    participant Upload as UploadFileUseCase
    participant Storage as MinIO
    participant DB as PostgreSQL / Outbox
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant Scan as ScanFileUseCase
    participant AV as ClamAV

    User->>API: POST /api/v1/files
    API->>Upload: upload(file stream)
    Upload->>Storage: Stream file to quarantine
    Storage-->>Upload: Stored
    Upload->>DB: Save PENDING_SCAN + scan request
    DB-->>Upload: Commit
    Upload-->>API: PENDING_SCAN
    API-->>User: 202 Accepted

    Note over DB,MQ: Outbox relay publishes after the upload transaction.
    DB->>MQ: Publish scan request
    MQ-->>Scan: Deliver scan request
    Scan->>Storage: Read file stream
    Storage-->>Scan: Stream bytes
    Scan->>AV: INSTREAM bytes
    AV-->>Scan: OK
    Scan->>DB: Save CLEAN
    Scan->>MQ: ACK

    Note over User,AV: Nominal path only: upload accepted, scan OK, file CLEAN.